  "description": "Apple Orchard | Pretend Play Printables is a fun and interactive activity set of printables, designed to spark creativity and imagination in children. With these printables, kids can immerse themselves in the role of an apple orchard owner, picking apples, setting up their own farm stand, and learning about different varieties of apples.\nThis set includes beautifully illustrated labels, price tags, shopping lists, and apple-themed signs, making it perfect for pretend play, educational activities, or autumn-themed lessons.\nYou will receive:\n* PDF with 14 pages\n* Endless possibilities!\nThis is a digital item; therefore, you will not receive a physical product.",
